Dialogue: 30,0:00:07.54,0:00:08.98,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 30,0:00:09.38,0:00:11.88,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,the "special place"?
Dialogue: 30,0:00:11.88,0:00:12.74,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:12.74,0:00:16.49,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,This is the place where you'll be able to get the most excited and powered up.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:16.88,0:00:17.78,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 30,0:00:23.00,0:00:25.76,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,'Kay, class is starting.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:25.76,0:00:26.64,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Be quiet.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:26.64,0:00:28.00,Dialogue,All,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 30,0:00:28.23,0:00:29.12,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Class?
Dialogue: 30,0:00:30.10,0:00:31.01,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 30,0:00:32.51,0:00:34.66,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,H-Hey...
Dialogue: 30,0:00:34.66,0:00:38.01,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You should be quiet, we're in the middle of class.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:39.13,0:00:41.02,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,S-Stop it...
Dialogue: 30,0:00:41.02,0:00:44.02,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Not here! No way!
Dialogue: 30,0:00:44.02,0:00:45.97,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You're too loud.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:45.97,0:00:48.02,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What if they notice?
Dialogue: 30,0:00:48.41,0:00:50.63,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,"What if they notice?"
Dialogue: 30,0:00:50.63,0:00:51.28,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 30,0:00:51.66,0:00:53.79,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,We shouldn't be doing this here!
Dialogue: 30,0:00:54.79,0:00:55.53,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Stop—
Dialogue: 30,0:00:57.05,0:00:58.20,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,You're kidding me...
Dialogue: 30,0:00:59.59,0:01:00.98,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 30,0:01:02.29,0:01:04.04,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,This is the finishing blow!
Dialogue: 30,0:01:17.18,0:01:18.80,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Next is Chidorigafuchi.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:24.21,0:01:25.06,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 30,0:01:25.36,0:01:26.71,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,N-Nothing...
Dialogue: 30,0:01:29.56,0:01:31.69,Dialogue Italics,A,0,0,0,,Oh no! They'll see!
Dialogue: 30,0:01:31.69,0:01:33.57,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Come on, solve the problem.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:33.97,0:01:35.57,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:36.51,0:01:37.88,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Hey, look.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:37.88,0:01:39.65,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Is she not wearing panties?
Dialogue: 30,0:01:39.65,0:01:40.58,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 30,0:01:41.20,0:01:43.44,Dialogue Italics,A,0,0,0,,Everybody's watching,
Dialogue: 30,0:01:43.44,0:01:45.58,Dialogue Italics,A,0,0,0,,including Kizuna.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:46.03,0:01:48.08,Dialogue Italics,A,0,0,0,,So why...
Dialogue: 30,0:01:48.61,0:01:50.59,Dialogue Italics,A,0,0,0,,Why am I so excited?
Dialogue: 30,0:01:51.06,0:01:52.45,Dialogue Italics,A,0,0,0,,Why does it feel so good?!
Dialogue: 30,0:01:54.09,0:01:59.09,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,Unimaginable embarrassment will bring out Aine's power.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:07.35,0:02:10.34,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,'Kay, that's all for today.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:17.83,0:02:19.55,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,You're such a big dummy!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:19.55,0:02:21.06,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I was so embarrassed!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:21.06,0:02:23.00,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Yeah, you did great.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:23.00,0:02:24.37,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Just a little more.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:28.24,0:02:29.14,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Aine?
