Dialogue: 30,0:04:13.65,0:04:15.78,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Sylvia, how's it going over there?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:15.78,0:04:19.32,Dialogue Italics,S,0,0,0,,Oh, stop it, Captain...
Dialogue: 30,0:04:19.32,0:04:20.49,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Sylvia?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:20.49,0:04:23.37,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,That girl is having a very nice dream right now.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:24.62,0:04:25.91,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:25.91,0:04:28.62,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Is it finally time for the last boss?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:32.04,0:04:34.46,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Neros and Kuros, I presume?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:34.46,0:04:38.63,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,It seems you've been giving our\N expeditionary forces a hard time.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:38.63,0:04:42.64,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,So I'll let you have a very special dream.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:43.93,0:04:45.39,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Heart Rebuild.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:47.56,0:04:50.27,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I-I was trying to hold back my embarrassment,
Dialogue: 30,0:04:50.27,0:04:51.90,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,and now I'm at my limit!
Dialogue: 30,0:04:52.15,0:04:54.90,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,If I move, I won't be able to hold it in.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:54.90,0:04:55.98,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:55.98,0:04:57.90,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Okay, so let me go to the restroom.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:59.70,0:05:00.90,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Kizuna?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:00.90,0:05:02.16,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:16.50,0:05:18.05,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:18.05,0:05:19.92,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I brought them all here...
Dialogue: 30,0:05:20.42,0:05:23.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to watch you perform your Climax Hybrid.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:23.72,0:05:25.93,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Y-You're kidding!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:25.93,0:05:27.06,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'm serious.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:29.68,0:05:30.81,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 30,0:05:32.56,0:05:33.69,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:34.36,0:05:35.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S...
Dialogue: 30,0:05:35.73,0:05:37.57,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,S-Stop it!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:37.57,0:05:40.07,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Don't look! Don't look at me!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:42.70,0:05:44.95,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Th-This is too much...
Dialogue: 30,0:05:45.53,0:05:49.50,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Any more and I won't be able to hold it in!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:50.45,0:05:52.50,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You don't have to.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:52.50,0:05:54.33,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Show them your true self.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:54.33,0:05:56.17,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I-I can't.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:57.34,0:05:58.59,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,It's too embarrassing!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:58.59,0:06:00.34,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:00.34,0:06:02.38,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'm right here next to you.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:02.38,0:06:03.51,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Kizuna!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:06.68,0:06:08.01,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I can't...
Dialogue: 30,0:06:09.64,0:06:11.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:14.40,0:06:15.19,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:15.19,0:06:16.61,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Climax Hybrid!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:29.20,0:06:30.62,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 30,0:06:31.29,0:06:33.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the light of my Immoral Weapon?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:42.51,0:06:43.59,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Aine?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:43.59,0:06:46.09,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:49.18,0:06:51.72,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Aine? Hang in there, Aine!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:53.77,0:06:55.48,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 30,0:06:55.85,0:06:58.40,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Aine, are you okay?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:58.40,0:06:59.73,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 30,0:07:01.28,0:07:03.11,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,My hair's still silver?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:03.11,0:07:05.74,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Did the Climax Hybrid fail?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:06.49,0:07:08.03,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:08.03,0:07:10.66,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I thought it would work for sure.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:11.49,0:07:13.08,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:13.08,0:07:14.00,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Aine.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:14.71,0:07:17.79,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I was about to get this incredible power,
Dialogue: 30,0:07:17.79,0:07:19.92,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,but I was too scared.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:20.46,0:07:22.46,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Don't blame yourself.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:22.46,0:07:24.26,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:24.26,0:07:25.30,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Kizuna!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:34.56,0:07:35.89,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What...
Dialogue: 30,0:07:35.89,0:07:37.31,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:41.44,0:07:42.69,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Himekawa!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:43.15,0:07:44.44,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Julicia!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:44.74,0:07:46.20,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Sylvia!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:46.78,0:07:48.20,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,It's useless.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:48.57,0:07:49.87,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:49.87,0:07:54.20,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,{\q2}Captain of the Batlantis Empire's Royal Guard, Zelshione.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:54.66,0:07:57.92,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Your cries won't reach them.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:59.29,0:08:04.13,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Their souls are currently floating deep within their minds.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:04.13,0:08:05.71,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Wh-What did you say?!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:09.22,0:08:10.34,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Where am I?!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:10.34,0:08:12.22,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Where are you, everyone?!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:20.10,0:08:21.23,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Tri-Head.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:24.73,0:08:26.99,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,You're so awful...
Dialogue: 30,0:08:27.28,0:08:30.07,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Why didn't you save me?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:30.07,0:08:32.99,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I didn't want to die...
Dialogue: 30,0:08:33.87,0:08:35.87,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,You're a liar!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:35.87,0:08:38.00,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 30,0:08:39.04,0:08:40.42,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Liar!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:41.29,0:08:44.63,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I tr-tried to save you...
Dialogue: 30,0:08:49.51,0:08:51.01,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Just hang in there, everyone.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:51.34,0:08:52.80,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,I'm on my way.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:54.56,0:08:55.39,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 30,0:09:02.02,0:09:02.77,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 30,0:09:03.27,0:09:04.31,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 30,0:09:10.99,0:09:12.45,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Scarlet...
Dialogue: 30,0:09:14.20,0:09:16.08,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Everyone, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:16.91,0:09:18.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:19.79,0:09:21.79,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,They're each being swallowed up by a nightmare,
Dialogue: 30,0:09:21.79,0:09:24.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,of a past that may have been,
Dialogue: 30,0:09:24.67,0:09:26.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,filled with pain and regrets.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:27.13,0:09:28.51,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:28.51,0:09:30.84,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,So basically, a psychological attack?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:30.84,0:09:33.97,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,A cowardly and shameful way of fighting without getting your own hands dirty!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:35.35,0:09:39.73,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Your feeble complaints can't even reach my ears.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:39.73,0:09:42.81,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,You never stood a chance.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:50.07,0:09:51.07,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,Scarlet!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:51.61,0:09:52.57,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,Sharon!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:52.95,0:09:54.57,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,Henrietta!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:54.57,0:09:55.82,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,It's no good!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:55.82,0:09:58.24,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,They aren't answering me!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:59.33,0:10:00.95,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Just what happened?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:00.95,0:10:01.62,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Reiri...
Dialogue: 30,0:10:03.50,0:10:06.34,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,New Magitech weapon attack detected in Area 11!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:06.34,0:10:08.00,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Counterattack system is crippled!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:12.47,0:10:15.51,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I'll show you what the Masters can do!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:15.93,0:10:17.97,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,And give us a raise while you're at it!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:19.85,0:10:23.27,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Amaterasu will...
Dialogue: 30,0:10:23.27,0:10:26.52,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,The Eros Overlord will manage something for sure.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:27.06,0:10:29.98,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,If you surrender to the Batlantis Empire,
Dialogue: 30,0:10:29.98,0:10:31.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll spare your lives.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:31.61,0:10:32.78,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:32.78,0:10:34.82,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Even you Lemurians have value,
Dialogue: 30,0:10:34.82,0:10:39.53,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,as cattle for harvesting life energy.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:39.99,0:10:42.91,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,How about it? I promise you a happy life.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:47.33,0:10:48.84,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:48.84,0:10:51.63,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,How could I be happy if I stopped being myself?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:51.63,0:10:53.09,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Kizuna...
Dialogue: 30,0:10:54.80,0:10:58.39,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,She doesn't seem to know who she really is, though.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:59.72,0:11:02.47,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Just from where did you get Zeros' core?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:03.23,0:11:05.52,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you've forgotten.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:05.52,0:11:07.15,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,"Where"?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:07.15,0:11:09.61,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,It's got nothing to do with you!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:09.61,0:11:12.15,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Even if I knew, I wouldn't tell you!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:14.78,0:11:16.36,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Wh-What is this?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:16.36,0:11:17.41,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Aine!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:18.57,0:11:19.41,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 30,0:11:20.66,0:11:23.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll send you on a trip through your own memories,
Dialogue: 30,0:11:24.58,0:11:27.83,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,so you can find where!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:40.43,0:11:41.51,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Bring Aine back.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:42.10,0:11:45.10,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Bring everyone back!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:47.48,0:11:49.10,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,You're just a man.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:49.10,0:11:53.11,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Do you really think you can lay a finger on me?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:53.57,0:11:54.78,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'll make you pay...
Dialogue: 30,0:11:54.78,0:11:56.86,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'll make you pay for this!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:57.74,0:11:59.78,Dialogue Alternate,K,0,0,0,,Eros!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:14.55,0:12:17.26,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Where am I supposed to go?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:17.26,0:12:20.01,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,You're going to look for the core, right?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:20.43,0:12:21.85,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:21.85,0:12:24.68,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,That's why I'm here, isn't it?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:32.98,0:12:34.44,Dialogue Flashback,Gi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:34.44,0:12:37.24,Dialogue Flashback,Gi,0,0,0,,So the core's already been installed?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:40.45,0:12:42.24,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Already been installed?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:56.51,0:12:57.46,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Is this...
Dialogue: 30,0:12:59.01,0:13:01.64,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:03.51,0:13:04.72,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:04.72,0:13:05.76,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You're in the way!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:06.97,0:13:09.35,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I should've known an incomplete Climax Hybrid
Dialogue: 30,0:13:09.35,0:13:10.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,wouldn't give me enough power!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:12.48,0:13:15.77,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,He fights for those he loves?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:15.77,0:13:18.82,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,How long will he last, I wonder?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:25.91,0:13:27.66,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:30.75,0:13:31.67,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:36.29,0:13:37.92,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Are you really sure?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:39.26,0:13:42.13,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,The truth lies beyond this door.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:42.13,0:13:45.55,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,But once you open it, there's no going back.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:45.55,0:13:47.18,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:47.18,0:13:49.10,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I don't...
Dialogue: 30,0:13:49.10,0:13:51.43,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 30,0:13:51.77,0:13:53.14,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,what I should do.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:54.48,0:13:55.98,Dialogue Flashback,K,0,0,0,,Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 30,0:14:08.20,0:14:09.70,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'm not done yet...
Dialogue: 30,0:14:15.46,0:14:16.71,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,At this rate...
Dialogue: 30,0:14:19.46,0:14:20.67,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Zeros Mode!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:35.27,0:14:38.48,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Bring everyone back!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:38.82,0:14:41.03,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,How interesting.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:41.03,0:14:43.61,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I had no idea such a Magitech armor existed.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:43.61,0:14:46.87,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I'll have to take my time examining it later.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:55.12,0:14:58.50,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,A man's screams can be rather pleasant, too!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:09.93,0:15:12.52,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,This was at least a little entertaining.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:13.22,0:15:14.14,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,I'm not done yet...
Dialogue: 30,0:15:15.60,0:15:17.44,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,I swore I'd save them all...
Dialogue: 30,0:15:18.19,0:15:20.27,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,That I wouldn't let them die...
Dialogue: 30,0:15:20.94,0:15:23.53,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,That I'd protect them.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:23.53,0:15:25.53,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,And that's what...
Dialogue: 30,0:15:26.70,0:15:29.12,Dialogue Flashback,R,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)}I don't need you anymore.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:29.12,0:15:30.87,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'm here for!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:38.17,0:15:39.29,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:45.67,0:15:46.93,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:47.38,0:15:49.51,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,You're always with me.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:51.18,0:15:53.68,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,We're with you, too.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:53.68,0:15:56.48,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,So feel us as much as you can.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:59.31,0:16:01.98,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Please use Sylvia!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:03.36,0:16:04.48,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 30,0:16:09.36,0:16:11.32,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,You don't know when to give up.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:11.87,0:16:13.12,Dialogue Italics,H,0,0,0,,Kizuna-kun!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:13.12,0:16:14.12,Dialogue Italics,Y,0,0,0,,Kizuna!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:14.12,0:16:15.04,Dialogue Italics,S,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:17.50,0:16:18.50,Dialogue Alternate,K,0,0,0,,Eros! {Ed: Sexiest transformation confirmed~ :p}
Dialogue: 30,0:16:55.37,0:16:57.50,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:58.16,0:16:59.91,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Amaterasu Mode!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:02.04,0:17:05.00,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Eros' Hybrid Count is rising!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:05.00,0:17:07.51,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,{That damn }Kizuna's in top form!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:07.92,0:17:10.30,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,But he hasn't done a Heart Hybrid.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:10.30,0:17:12.89,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Pleasure and excitement without even touching?
Dialogue: 30,0:17:13.68,0:17:15.51,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Ecstasy that goes beyond the body.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:16.01,0:17:18.31,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Carnality between minds calling to one another.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:18.31,0:17:21.02,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,This is the ultimate form of love.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:21.02,0:17:24.02,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,A miracle has just occurred!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:25.27,0:17:26.27,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:30.24,0:17:31.03,Dialogue Alternate,K,0,0,0,,Neros!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:39.33,0:17:40.08,Dialogue Alternate,K,0,0,0,,Kuros!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:44.29,0:17:45.21,Dialogue Alternate,K,0,0,0,,Taros!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:47.05,0:17:50.88,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:58.39,0:18:00.31,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You're all that's left!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:00.31,0:18:02.23,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate me!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:07.98,0:18:10.74,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,After that scream, how about some last words—
Dialogue: 30,0:18:12.07,0:18:14.24,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I laid more than a finger on you.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:20.54,0:18:22.29,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Y-You...
Dialogue: 30,0:18:23.00,0:18:26.00,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,How dare you do that to my Teros?
Dialogue: 30,0:18:29.00,0:18:30.17,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:31.01,0:18:32.34,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'm so glad.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:36.89,0:18:37.39,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,When—
Dialogue: 30,0:18:37.39,0:18:41.81,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,You're the first person to push me this far.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:42.52,0:18:43.98,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I'll praise you for that much.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:48.52,0:18:50.61,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,As a reward,
Dialogue: 30,0:18:50.61,0:18:53.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll have {\i1}her{\i0} finish you!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:59.49,0:19:01.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\ko65}{\2a&HFF&}A{\ko27}i{\ko100}ne...
Dialogue: 30,0:19:03.37,0:19:05.50,Dialogue Flashback,K,0,0,0,,I'll think about it together with you!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:07.13,0:19:08.67,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:08.67,0:19:12.21,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Kizuna was protecting me, even back then.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:12.21,0:19:14.84,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,But I got scared and ran away.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:15.22,0:19:18.09,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Maybe it's not too late.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:25.10,0:19:27.31,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Wh-What is this?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:27.31,0:19:29.48,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,No! This isn't...
Dialogue: 30,0:19:29.48,0:19:31.11,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:31.44,0:19:32.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:34.53,0:19:36.32,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Aine-san, what are you—?!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:37.91,0:19:39.74,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Stop! Aine!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:40.99,0:19:42.62,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Don't!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:42.87,0:19:45.54,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,{\ko92}{\2a&HFF&}Kizuna! {\ko91}Kizuna! {\ko91}Kizuna!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:45.62,0:19:47.87,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I want to feel you!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:47.87,0:19:49.13,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,With my hands,
Dialogue: 30,0:19:49.13,0:19:50.38,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,with my body,
Dialogue: 30,0:19:50.38,0:19:51.63,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,with everything that I am!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:52.00,0:19:53.38,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I want to hold you!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:53.38,0:19:55.38,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I want to become one with you!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:55.38,0:19:58.01,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,That's why I want power!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:00.26,0:20:02.39,Dialogue Italics,A,0,0,0,,Welcome back, me.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:09.10,0:20:10.52,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Aine?
Dialogue: 30,0:20:11.36,0:20:12.73,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,She's back?
Dialogue: 30,0:20:16.61,0:20:17.49,Dialogue Alternate,A,0,0,0,,Zeros.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:22.70,0:20:24.54,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Th-That can't be...
Dialogue: 30,0:20:27.54,0:20:30.12,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Th-The forbidden...
Dialogue: 30,0:20:38.05,0:20:40.55,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:41.68,0:20:43.10,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,Aine,
Dialogue: 30,0:20:43.10,0:20:45.10,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,I will...
Dialogue: 30,0:20:47.02,0:20:48.39,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,protect you!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:08.79,0:21:10.75,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Code Breaker.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:16.05,0:21:17.34,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,My Gear?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:19.17,0:21:22.59,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I-I can't go down here!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:38.03,0:21:40.03,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:40.03,0:21:41.28,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,The sealing system!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:41.65,0:21:43.78,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,M-Magical energy dissipating!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:44.53,0:21:47.54,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,23,,The Entrance's Magitech signal is dropping rapidly!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:48.08,0:21:50.29,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,The sealing system has activated!
